================================================================================================================
ENVELOPE DESCRIPTION -- target source 30m
================================================================================================================
  60,000 episodes, 5 features: vol_48, vratio, vol_slope, sandwich, off_mark
  target: running MAE and MFE, sign-folded, UNCLAMPED (see docstring)
  quantiles (0.05, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 0.95)   horizons ['0.5h', '1h', '2h', '5h', '10h']

  THIS RUN USES 30-MINUTE CLOSES. The true envelope is strictly worse:
  the worst point inside a bar is never observed. Earlier work puts the
  understatement at roughly 0.3 sigma, one-sided, scaling with volatility.
  CLIMATOLOGY IS BIASED THE SAME WAY, so comparative skill should be
  largely unaffected -- an assumption, stated and not corrected for.

  TRENDING = bottom tercile of vratio. Cutoff 1.47220, computed on the
  FIT BLOCK ONLY (41,936 rows) and applied as a fixed
  number to both blocks -- never recomputed on held-out data.
    ALL        60,000 episodes  (18,064 held out)
    TRENDING   18,669 episodes  (4,690 held out)

